# MoE CPU/GPU Collaborative Inference ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** research into expert caching, reuse and CPU/GPU collaboration.

**LEONES status:** P2/P3.

## Summary

The project explores keeping experts available across CPU and GPU memory and reusing them according to routing behaviour.

## ODS fit

The important concept is not a standalone server but a scheduling policy that considers cache state, transfer cost and expert reuse.

This can inform a future ODS execution optimizer.